 * every interpolated development-only placeholder (POSTGRES_PASSWORD,
 * and the credentials embedded in each connection string) in plaintext
 * — which is exactly why `composeConfigQuiet` exists. This function
 * therefore parses that output in-process and returns only the narrow,
 * credential-free shape above; it never returns, logs, or includes the
 * raw document in an error message. Callers must keep that property.
